+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates in the simpler JSON Merge Patch format (RFC 7386). The library supports only JSON Patch (RFC 6902), so those updates cannot be applied.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386 and returning the merged document as a new value.
+- Update the README, which currently says Merge Patch is unsupported.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+None.
+
+## Impact
+
+- New `src/merge-patch.ts`, new export in `src/index.ts`, new tests, README update. No new dependencies, no breaking changes.
